		{
			title = "{area:538}: kill these as you meet them",
			note = "Ride south-west to {area:537}, the volcano in the middle of the crater. Bloodpetal Flayers grow around its foot.\nSouth of the hot springs, Dinosaur Bones lie on the ground among the Stegodons and drop from the Diemetradons nearby, which also carry the scales {npc:9998} wants. Careful: the Stegodons are elites (52-53): pick the bones up around them, don't pull them; the Elder Diemetradons are 53-55, take the smaller ones. Ravasaurs hunt in packs in the south-west: their claws are for {npc:8659}, and now and then one carries a Mangled Journal (a rare drop: take its quest only if you get one). Avoid Gruff, a level 57 Stegodon.\nRide south-west along the western cliffs. Bloodpetal Trappers grow in the jungle there. Careful: the biggest Trappers are 53: pull them one at a time.",
